{
  "contract": "ito-home",
  "version": 3,
  "features": {
    "featured": 1
  },
  "notes": [
    "Bytes are postcard. A HomeLayout is a Vec of HomeComponent (optional title, optional subtitle, then the value). Featured is HomeComponentValue variant 17; a plugin reaches it only through get_home_v2.",
    "variant.featured pins the variant byte: its hex is the value alone, and its first byte is the variant index.",
    "Each wire case decodes as its type, re-encodes to the same bytes, and gives the verdict of catalog::validate_home. expect is the host verdict: ok, or violation:<code>.",
    "Each downgrade case takes the layout a plugin returns (input), the host's features bit set, and the layout the export encodes and checks (output). expect is the verdict of the output. With the featured bit set the output is the input.",
    "Downgrade: a featured component lowers to BigScroller, AnimeBigScroller or NovelBigScroller when every entry has one kind, otherwise MediaBigScroller. Its title and subtitle stay; its banner, logo, tagline, summary, badge, chips, accent, action and listing are dropped; a component without items is dropped; other components are unchanged. An entry is never changed, so a banner never becomes its cover.",
    "Validation order for a home layout: components in order. A featured component checks its item count, then auto_advance, then each item in order (entry, banner and logo lengths, banner and logo schemes, tagline, summary, badge label, badge rank, chip count, each chip's text and then number, accent), then duplicate (kind, key) pairs. The first violation wins.",
    "Strings are compared as exact UTF-8 bytes; every length is in UTF-8 bytes.",
    "codes lists the rule codes this fixture adds to ito_rs::catalog::Rule; the rest are pinned by fixtures/catalog-v3.json."
  ],
  "codes": [
    "count.featured",
    "count.chips",
    "length.text",
    "url.scheme",
    "color.range"
  ],
  "limits": {
    "max_featured_items": 20,
    "max_featured_chips": 6,
    "max_tagline_bytes": 256,
    "max_summary_bytes": 2048,
    "max_badge_label_bytes": 64,
    "max_chip_text_bytes": 64,
    "max_badge_rank": 999,
    "min_auto_advance": 2.0,
    "max_auto_advance": 60.0,
    "max_accent": 16777215,
    "min_chip_year": 1800.0,
    "max_chip_year": 2200.0,
    "max_chip_rating": 10.0,
    "max_chip_units": 1000000.0,
    "max_url_bytes": 4096
  },
